WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.917 --> 00:00:04.208
Witcher.

00:00:07.454 --> 00:00:09.583
You say this is all life is to you.

00:00:10.794 --> 00:00:11.875
Monsters and money.

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:17.042
I feel something out there
waits for you.

00:00:17.819 --> 00:00:18.708
Something more.

00:00:24.208 --> 00:00:25.667
How much for this beast?

00:00:26.375 --> 00:00:27.708
Four marks.

00:00:28.533 --> 00:00:29.422
Let me out!

00:00:29.949 --> 00:00:32.870
Magic is organizing Chaos.

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:34.375
Without control…

00:00:34.458 --> 00:00:35.625
Your hand!

00:00:35.708 --> 00:00:37.000
…Chaos will kill you.

00:00:38.667 --> 00:00:41.375
Demonstrated beautifully.
Thank you, Fringilla.

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:44.750
There are mages
who ignore their emotions.

00:00:45.025 --> 00:00:48.083
And then there are mages
who are consumed by them.

00:00:48.535 --> 00:00:50.967
It is your job to control Chaos,

00:00:51.208 --> 00:00:52.250
not become it.

00:00:55.625 --> 00:00:57.458
-What's your name?
-Istredd.

00:00:57.950 --> 00:00:59.375
You can trust me.

00:00:59.587 --> 00:01:00.458
What do you want?

00:01:02.014 --> 00:01:03.264
I want to be powerful.

00:01:03.757 --> 00:01:06.007
There is a cost to all creation.

00:01:07.708 --> 00:01:09.042
To be reborn,

00:01:10.289 --> 00:01:11.500
you will bear no more.

00:01:12.833 --> 00:01:14.417
I know who you are.

00:01:15.083 --> 00:01:16.500
You're a monster hunter.

00:01:18.542 --> 00:01:19.500
White hair,

00:01:19.948 --> 00:01:21.042
big, old loner.

00:01:21.542 --> 00:01:23.208
We don't want
your kind here, Witcher.

00:01:23.292 --> 00:01:24.875
You mutant son of a bitch.

00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:28.252
You're the witcher,
Geralt of Rivia.

00:01:29.143 --> 00:01:30.450
A job I've got for you.

00:01:31.033 --> 00:01:32.117
Evil is evil.

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:34.542
Lesser, greater,

00:01:35.417 --> 00:01:36.300
middling,

00:01:36.542 --> 00:01:37.500
it's all the same.

00:01:38.032 --> 00:01:39.532
What if they come after you?

00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:42.875
Why not kill them?

00:01:44.292 --> 00:01:46.958
Because then
I am what they say I am.

00:01:47.372 --> 00:01:49.199
The Butcher of Blaviken!

00:01:52.208 --> 00:01:55.000
The girl in the woods
is your destiny.

00:01:56.083 --> 00:01:58.083
I'd say you have got
a bit of an image problem.

00:01:58.167 --> 00:01:59.055
Go away.

00:01:59.375 --> 00:02:01.625
I won't be but silent backup.

00:02:01.708 --> 00:02:02.792
Oh my gosh.

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:10.784
Elves are the original sorcerers
of the Continent.

00:02:10.859 --> 00:02:13.792
Mages taught the first humans
how to turn Chaos into magic.

00:02:13.875 --> 00:02:15.792
My elders were slaughtered.

00:02:15.875 --> 00:02:18.500
I was once
Filavandrel of the Silver Towers.

00:02:18.583 --> 00:02:20.132
Show the humans

00:02:20.207 --> 00:02:23.333
that you are more
than what they fear you to be.

00:02:25.333 --> 00:02:27.125
This is where we part ways, Bard.

00:02:27.208 --> 00:02:29.500
Look, I promised to change
the public's tune about you.

00:02:29.583 --> 00:02:31.458
At least allow me to try.

00:02:31.542 --> 00:02:34.250
Toss a coin to your witcher

00:02:34.333 --> 00:02:36.394
O, Valley of Plenty

00:02:36.469 --> 00:02:38.833
Toss a coin to your witcher

00:02:38.917 --> 00:02:44.833
A friend of humanity

00:02:44.917 --> 00:02:45.789
Thank you!

00:02:45.857 --> 00:02:48.816
I've made you famous, Witcher.

00:02:49.375 --> 00:02:50.917
All I'm asking for is one night

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.000
bodyguarding your very best friend
in the whole wide world.

00:02:53.083 --> 00:02:54.292
I'm not your friend.

00:02:54.917 --> 00:02:56.625
All rise for Her Majesty,

00:02:56.708 --> 00:02:59.292
Queen Calanthe of Cintra.

00:02:59.375 --> 00:03:01.042
Can't have anyone finding out
who you actually are.

00:03:01.125 --> 00:03:04.831
Geralt of Rivia,
the mighty witcher!

00:03:04.931 --> 00:03:05.792
Shit.

00:03:05.875 --> 00:03:08.458
Come, Witcher.
Take a seat by my side.

00:03:08.542 --> 00:03:12.458
These suitors will vie all night
for Princess Pavetta's hand.

00:03:12.542 --> 00:03:14.958
I've come to claim
your daughter's hand in marriage.

00:03:15.042 --> 00:03:16.167
No!

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:19.667
I come to claim Pavetta

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:21.542
by the Law of Surprise.

00:03:21.625 --> 00:03:23.958
I saved your husband,
King Roegner,

00:03:24.042 --> 00:03:25.500
from a certain death.

00:03:25.583 --> 00:03:27.958
I chose the Law of Surprise
as payment.

00:03:28.042 --> 00:03:29.667
Slay this beast!

00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:32.583
The Law of Surprise
is as old as mankind itself.

00:03:35.167 --> 00:03:37.458
When one has saved another
from certain death…

00:03:37.542 --> 00:03:38.750
No!

00:03:39.833 --> 00:03:42.625
…the Law of Surprise
can be claimed

00:03:42.708 --> 00:03:44.042
to pay that debt.

00:03:44.542 --> 00:03:46.667
Destiny determines the surprise.

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:51.292
Your blessing of this marriage

00:03:51.375 --> 00:03:53.250
has fulfilled a destiny.

00:03:53.333 --> 00:03:55.792
You saved my life.
I must repay you.

00:03:55.875 --> 00:03:58.833
I claim the tradition as you have,
the Law of Surprise.

00:03:58.917 --> 00:04:00.292
What have you done, Witcher?

00:04:00.375 --> 00:04:01.667
Destiny can go f--

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:05.572
Fuck.

00:04:05.667 --> 00:04:08.458
You're bound to this child
whether you like it or not.

00:04:08.739 --> 00:04:11.250
I'm getting out of here. Alone.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:12.917
Hello.

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:15.720
What's it been, years?
What are you fishing for?

00:04:15.795 --> 00:04:17.375
A djinn. I can't sleep.

00:04:17.458 --> 00:04:19.458
Just maybe
this has got something to do

00:04:19.542 --> 00:04:21.042
with the Law of Surprise, destiny,

00:04:21.125 --> 00:04:23.167
being unable to escape
the child that belongs to you.

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:24.117
No!

00:04:27.125 --> 00:04:28.167
Jaskier?

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:32.279
He needs a magical remedy.

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:35.667
-You must be the mage.
-Yennefer of Vengerberg.

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:38.292
He was attacked by a djinn.
Fix it.

00:04:38.375 --> 00:04:39.250
A djinn?

00:04:39.833 --> 00:04:42.250
-Do you doubt my capabilities?
-No.

00:04:42.833 --> 00:04:43.958
Just your intentions.

00:04:44.708 --> 00:04:46.083
She wants to be the vessel.

00:04:46.792 --> 00:04:47.669
Don't!

00:04:47.769 --> 00:04:49.525
You seem to want
to meet your end.

00:04:49.583 --> 00:04:50.542
As do you.

00:04:52.165 --> 00:04:53.325
Make your wish.

00:04:53.747 --> 00:04:55.375
You can have anything you want.

00:04:55.458 --> 00:04:57.250
I wish…

00:05:06.208 --> 00:05:07.125
They're alive.

00:05:08.125 --> 00:05:09.500
They're really alive.

00:05:11.583 --> 00:05:13.625
The moment I dread most

00:05:14.208 --> 00:05:15.667
is when it fades,

00:05:16.333 --> 00:05:17.875
when you're really gone.

00:05:18.875 --> 00:05:20.167
You left first.

00:05:20.792 --> 00:05:22.628
I woke up in that destroyed house,

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:24.300
and you were gone.

00:05:26.125 --> 00:05:27.500
A short while ago,

00:05:27.583 --> 00:05:29.958
a green dragon landed
across the border

00:05:30.042 --> 00:05:31.994
in King Niedamir's mountains.

00:05:32.069 --> 00:05:34.518
He's commissioned
a hunt to kill it.

00:05:34.792 --> 00:05:37.325
-We really can't get involved.
-I'm in.

00:05:37.542 --> 00:05:38.500
Mother of…

00:05:39.022 --> 00:05:43.125
I've walked this earth for decades
without coming across a witcher.

00:05:43.208 --> 00:05:45.375
And then the first one I meet
I can't get rid of.

00:05:45.782 --> 00:05:46.917
What are you doing here, Yen?

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:48.125
I'm here for the dragon.

00:05:48.208 --> 00:05:50.507
Do not tell me
you've traveled all this way

00:05:50.582 --> 00:05:53.458
for made-up fertility cures
using fresh dragon hearts.

00:05:53.542 --> 00:05:55.000
-They're not made up.
-They are.

00:05:55.083 --> 00:05:56.689
What could you possibly want
with a child?

00:05:56.789 --> 00:05:58.042
They took my choice!

00:05:58.125 --> 00:05:59.250
I want it back.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.143
The dwarves,
they're leading us to a shorter path.

00:06:03.417 --> 00:06:05.480
Nilfgaard has returned,
burning through the south.

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:07.182
With Fringilla as their mage.

00:06:07.726 --> 00:06:10.009
Cahir, we must move.

00:06:10.380 --> 00:06:11.987
They're inching closer by the day.

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:14.542
Won't be long
till they try and take Cintra.

00:06:15.042 --> 00:06:16.134
Come with me.

00:06:16.798 --> 00:06:18.333
I can take care of myself.

00:06:18.417 --> 00:06:19.917
You don't always have to.

00:06:27.833 --> 00:06:30.042
I was afraid that mountain
would take you from me.

00:06:32.792 --> 00:06:34.542
I'm not leaving
till I've killed that dragon.

00:06:34.625 --> 00:06:35.530
Yen.

00:06:36.458 --> 00:06:38.247
-What will it solve?
-It will solve everything.

00:06:38.958 --> 00:06:40.500
She was protecting her baby.

00:06:40.583 --> 00:06:41.542
No!

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:49.407
Did you always want
to become a mother?

00:06:49.542 --> 00:06:50.667
I dreamed

00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:53.572
of becoming important to someone.

00:06:54.292 --> 00:06:56.042
You're important to me.

00:06:57.375 --> 00:06:59.958
-The djinn.
-That's why we can't escape each other.

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:03.667
You made a wish.

00:07:04.833 --> 00:07:06.625
-It's magic.
-It's real, Yen.

00:07:06.708 --> 00:07:07.948
How could we ever know?

00:07:08.636 --> 00:07:11.542
-I made that wish to save your life.
-I didn't need your help!

00:07:11.625 --> 00:07:14.708
A child is no way
to boost your fragile ego, Yen!

00:07:14.792 --> 00:07:16.625
I'll take advice from you
about children

00:07:16.708 --> 00:07:19.125
as soon as you take responsibility
for the one you bound to you

00:07:19.208 --> 00:07:20.625
and then abandoned!

00:07:20.708 --> 00:07:23.208
The sorceress
will never regain her womb.

00:07:24.042 --> 00:07:26.542
And though you didn't want
to lose her, Geralt,

00:07:27.042 --> 00:07:27.958
you will.

00:07:29.125 --> 00:07:30.250
He already has.

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:33.667
You wanted to show me
what I was missing.

00:07:34.292 --> 00:07:35.333
There she goes.

00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:37.500
What a day--

00:07:37.583 --> 00:07:38.708
Damn it, Jaskier!

00:07:39.625 --> 00:07:41.708
If life could give me one blessing,

00:07:41.792 --> 00:07:44.542
it would be
to take you off my hands.

00:07:45.125 --> 00:07:46.292
Right, then.

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:48.250
See you around, Geralt.

00:07:50.091 --> 00:07:52.331
You've come
for your Child of Surprise.

00:07:53.083 --> 00:07:55.458
Princess Cirilla
has been raised by Calanthe

00:07:55.542 --> 00:07:56.750
since her parents died.

00:07:56.833 --> 00:07:59.292
Pavetta and Duny's ship
was lost at sea.

00:07:59.375 --> 00:08:02.125
Have you been
hiding your head in the sand?

00:08:02.557 --> 00:08:04.708
Why do you think she's not safe?

00:08:05.458 --> 00:08:08.375
I saw an army,
a sea of black and gold.

00:08:08.917 --> 00:08:11.000
Why would I give my only heir
to someone

00:08:11.083 --> 00:08:13.083
who never cared enough
to come back for her?

00:08:13.167 --> 00:08:14.458
Maybe that army won't come.

00:08:14.542 --> 00:08:16.708
And if they do,
maybe you'll be ready.

00:08:16.792 --> 00:08:19.292
But I'm here to protect the girl.

00:08:19.375 --> 00:08:20.583
Get him out of my sight.

00:08:22.708 --> 00:08:25.861
The Nilfgaardian force
crossed the Amell Pass.

00:08:26.208 --> 00:08:28.708
Should we fall,
your granddaughter will rule.

00:08:29.542 --> 00:08:30.667
They're already here.

00:08:32.708 --> 00:08:34.667
Report any findings immediately!

00:08:35.708 --> 00:08:36.792
Hello, Yennefer.

00:08:36.875 --> 00:08:38.583
How long do you see yourself here?

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:40.583
Because I may be missing you.

00:08:40.667 --> 00:08:42.208
I'm sorry you chose power.

00:08:47.391 --> 00:08:48.329
His loss.

00:08:48.729 --> 00:08:49.583
Piss off.

00:08:49.667 --> 00:08:51.356
I would,
but we don't have much time.

00:08:51.627 --> 00:08:52.958
Tissaia asked for me?

00:08:53.042 --> 00:08:55.625
She said you're the best student
she ever taught.

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:57.625
Why are you all here?

00:08:57.708 --> 00:08:59.958
An emergency conclave
of the Northern mages.

00:09:00.042 --> 00:09:01.483
Nilfgaard took Marnadal.

00:09:04.542 --> 00:09:06.250
They're attacking Cintra.

00:09:07.037 --> 00:09:09.337
We can stop Nilfgaard

00:09:09.458 --> 00:09:11.333
if we act now.

00:09:11.417 --> 00:09:14.667
Cintra's a lost cause.
Let them reap what they sow.

00:09:16.417 --> 00:09:19.042
Vilgefortz and I and some others
are going to fight.

00:09:19.125 --> 00:09:20.208
You should join us.

00:09:21.458 --> 00:09:22.661
The witcher.

00:09:23.232 --> 00:09:24.500
If I can bring him here…

00:09:24.634 --> 00:09:25.497
Geralt?

00:09:25.597 --> 00:09:28.792
…to Ciri, destiny may
yet side with us.

00:09:37.941 --> 00:09:39.625
-He's gone.
-We must go, Your Highness.

00:09:39.708 --> 00:09:42.167
No!

00:09:43.424 --> 00:09:45.667
Find Geralt of Rivia.

00:09:46.417 --> 00:09:48.125
He is your destiny.

00:09:54.792 --> 00:09:55.708
Hey!

00:09:56.417 --> 00:09:57.458
Go.

00:10:02.875 --> 00:10:04.208
Why is Nilfgaard here?

00:10:11.583 --> 00:10:12.447
Do not--

00:10:17.125 --> 00:10:18.292
No!

00:10:19.233 --> 00:10:21.046
Princess Cirilla!

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:27.000
You're an elf.

00:10:27.583 --> 00:10:28.458
I'm Dara.

00:10:28.881 --> 00:10:29.756
I'm Ciri.

00:10:38.217 --> 00:10:39.425
Come on, get moving!

00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:41.167
We will find her.

00:10:42.417 --> 00:10:44.125
She's in Brokilon Forest.

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:48.022
Armies are not the way in
to Brokilon Forest.

00:10:50.557 --> 00:10:52.965
Mousesack, he helped raise me.

00:10:54.083 --> 00:10:56.792
You don't know what she is.

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:00.917
Bring me the girl alive.

00:11:01.867 --> 00:11:04.264
What are you, Child?

00:11:08.625 --> 00:11:11.500
Cintran refugees.
Dead at least a week.

00:11:12.206 --> 00:11:13.500
Come on, Roach.

00:11:13.781 --> 00:11:15.250
Back to Kaer Morhen.

00:11:15.333 --> 00:11:16.458
Don't leave!

00:11:26.667 --> 00:11:27.667
Fuck.

00:11:30.917 --> 00:11:31.833
Mousesack!

00:11:33.792 --> 00:11:35.833
Something's off about this, Ciri.

00:11:35.917 --> 00:11:37.792
My grandmother's sash.

00:11:38.375 --> 00:11:40.042
We're the saviors of the Continent?

00:11:40.125 --> 00:11:41.250
There are only 22 of us.

00:11:41.333 --> 00:11:43.542
There's only one way
for Nilfgaard to move north.

00:11:43.625 --> 00:11:44.833
Through Sodden Hill.

00:11:44.917 --> 00:11:46.292
They're two days away.

00:11:46.958 --> 00:11:48.875
We have sent word
to the Northern Kingdoms

00:11:48.958 --> 00:11:50.583
to join us to defend their lands.

00:11:50.667 --> 00:11:52.792
-When is that?
-Within two days.

00:11:53.792 --> 00:11:56.042
-I've had enough of you.
-Mousesack, stop!

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:04.167
If I stay with you any longer…

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:05.833
-Kill him.
-…I'll be dead too.

00:12:06.667 --> 00:12:08.167
I can't be there for you anymore.

00:12:16.708 --> 00:12:19.250
-Nilfgaard's looking for you.
-No!

00:12:21.872 --> 00:12:25.417
The Time of the White Chill
and the White Light is nigh,

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:29.333
the Time of Madness
and the Time of Contempt.

00:12:32.949 --> 00:12:34.116
What happened?

00:12:35.083 --> 00:12:36.250
They came for me.

00:12:37.333 --> 00:12:39.125
They got what they deserved.

00:12:41.333 --> 00:12:43.458
We're safer when we stick together.

00:12:45.250 --> 00:12:46.375
Nilfgaard.

00:12:48.958 --> 00:12:50.042
They're here.

00:12:58.417 --> 00:12:59.458
Careful now.

00:12:59.829 --> 00:13:01.208
You got bit, Butcher.

00:13:02.042 --> 00:13:04.035
How is Nilfgaard's army
here already?

00:13:04.637 --> 00:13:05.625
They're closing in.

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:08.442
We can't wait for the Northern
Kingdoms. We have to fight.

00:13:10.792 --> 00:13:12.542
Vilgefortz, now.

00:13:21.367 --> 00:13:22.819
They've breached the gate.

00:13:25.458 --> 00:13:26.458
Triss!

00:13:30.542 --> 00:13:31.900
How dare you leave your--

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:44.875
Help… me.

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:47.580
Vilgefor--

00:13:48.583 --> 00:13:51.708
How far from your home
to the battlefield? To Sodden?

00:13:52.792 --> 00:13:55.175
Yennefer,
to save these people,

00:13:55.275 --> 00:13:56.565
this Continent,

00:13:56.701 --> 00:13:58.792
let your Chaos explode.

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:10.667
Yennefer?

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:14.625
Yennefer!

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:19.417
-Yennefer!
-Yennefer!

00:14:20.708 --> 00:14:22.042
Yennefer!

00:14:45.583 --> 00:14:48.125
People linked by destiny
will always find each other.

00:14:53.164 --> 00:14:54.042
Who is Yennefer?

